Third-party supplier geometry — NOT covered by this project's licences.

Files in this directory are CAD models of purchased, off-the-shelf components,
obtained from their manufacturers or distributors. They are the property of
those suppliers and are used here under the suppliers' own terms. They are
excluded from the CERN Open Hardware Licence that covers the rest of `cad/`,
and from every other licence named in the repository root LICENSE.

Provenance for each file — supplier, part number, source URL, checksum and
redistribution terms — is recorded in `vendor-index.csv` in this directory.

Files marked `fetch-only` in that manifest may not be redistributed and are
therefore not committed. Only their manifest row is. Fetch them from the
supplier before CAD work.

Removing or replacing a supplier's file does not change the licence of the
project's own design files. See the repository root LICENSE for the full
licensing overview and TRADEMARKS.md for reserved marks.
